Create window titled "Clicker OS" size 500 x 280
Set score to 0

Draw box at 15, 15 size 470 x 250 filled with "#12131C" as cardBg
Draw text "Score: 0" at 35, 50 colored "#00ffcc" as scoreDisplay

Draw button "Tap (+1)" at 35, 90 size 120 x 45 colored "#ff0055" as tapBtn
Draw button "Boost (+5)" at 170, 90 size 130 x 45 colored "#00aaff" as boostBtn
Draw button "Reset" at 315, 90 size 110 x 45 colored "#33334e" as resetBtn

On click tapBtn:
    Increase score by 1
    Set text of scoreDisplay to "Score: " + score
End

On click boostBtn:
    Increase score by 5
    Set text of scoreDisplay to "Score: " + score
End

On click resetBtn:
    Set score to 0
    Set text of scoreDisplay to "Score: 0"
End
